			<item>
				<title>简介</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/introduction/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 25 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/introduction/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;介绍&#34;&gt;介绍&lt;a href=&#34;#%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://nginx.org/en/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;Nginx&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; 是一个高性能的HTTP和反向代理web服务器。其特点是占有内存少，并发能力强，事实上nginx的并发能力确实在同类型的网页服务器中表现较好，中国大陆使用nginx网站用户有：百度、京东、新浪、网易、腾讯、淘宝等。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>基础概念</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/foundation/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 31 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/foundation/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;代理服务&#34;&gt;代理服务&lt;a href=&#34;#%e4%bb%a3%e7%90%86%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;正向代理&#34;&gt;正向代理&lt;a href=&#34;#%e6%ad%a3%e5%90%91%e4%bb%a3%e7%90%86&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;正向代理&lt;/strong&gt;： 用户通过代理服务去请求目标服务器&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Nginx</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 31 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/nginx/</guid>
				<description>&lt;!-- VOLUME_OVERVIEW_START --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Nginx 是一款高性能 HTTP/反向代理服务器，本文档从基础代理服务原理入手，详解配置文件结构、Docker 部署与路由配置方法。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- VOLUME_OVERVIEW_END --&gt;</description>
